# ShellCheck settings for this repo.
#
# SC2020 is disabled NARROWLY and temporarily:
#
#   scripts/agent-dev.sh line 177 uses `tr ',[]' '\n\n\n'`, whose replacement set
#   repeats \n. ShellCheck flags it as info ("tr replaces sets of chars, not
#   words"), which is correct about tr but not a bug here - the duplicates are
#   harmless because the mapping is char->char. The build step still fails,
#   because `shellcheck` exits non-zero on ANY finding and the step runs under
#   `sh -e`.
#
# `tr -d '[]' | tr ',' '\n'` is the clearer spelling, but agent-dev.sh is
# GENERATED by genproj: editing it here would be overwritten on the next
# regeneration, so the fix belongs upstream in the generator. Until that lands,
# this is the narrowest thing that keeps a real finding from masking the smoke
# gate. Remove this file once genproj emits the two-stage tr.
disable=SC2020
